  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disaster Aid USA core relief expertise is in shelter, clean water, emergency supplies as in solar lighting that also charge cell phones, hygiene kits, mosquito nets, tarps, food etc.  We worked in Puerto Rico extensively after Hurricane  Maria bring clean water and shelter to remote communities.  DAUSA try to find the communities other don&apos;t reach as they concentrate on larger cities.</narrative>
